Identification\nInstantly identify species with scientific and common names powered by Plant.id.\n\n### Health Analysis\nGet a health score (0-100) with detailed assessment. The AI detects disease, nutrient deficiency, overwatering, and other issues.\n\n### Care Recommendations\nReceive actionable tips tailored to your plant's condition, including watering, light, and treatment guidance.\n\n### Voice Input\nAdd context using voice. Describe what you notice, and the AI incorporates your observations.\n\n### Plant Journal\nTrack all your plants. Review history and monitor health trends over time.\n\n## Perfect For\n\n- Home gardeners improving plant care\n- Plant parents learning to spot issues early\n- Anyone wanting healthier plants\n\n---\n\n*Requires internet connection.*\n", "short_description": "Your AI plant care assistant in VR. Point, scan, and get instant plant identification, health analysis, and custom care tips from your smart AI assistant. Voice input supported.                             "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://exreality.ai/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "eXReality AI LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://exreality.ai/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "257